components.specification:
@IsTest class, with sharing. It uses TestDataFactory (CMP-009) to create two CSR users, a manager user assigned Maintenance_Supervisor_Manager (CMP-068) and added to group Maintenance_Supervisors_Managers (CMP-066, resolved by DeveloperName), and a restricted user with no permission set or group.

It inserts 200 Maintenance Request cases spread across the CSRs and two Maintenance_Team__c values. It then sets Escalation_Due__c for half to NOW() minus 1 hour and for half to NOW() plus 1 day. It also sets Status to Resolved and Closed on a subset of the past-due cases.

It asserts through WITH USER_MODE queries in System.runAs blocks and Formula.recalculateFormulas. It contains no production logic.
